        <mxCell id="sub_robust" value="&lt;b&gt;robustness-agent/&lt;/b&gt; ★ true subprocess&lt;br&gt;src/robustness_agent/main.py · agent.py · conductor.py · rca.py ·&lt;br&gt;factory.py · config.py · models.py&lt;br&gt;sub-packages: checks · decision · findings · monitors · providers ·&lt;br&gt;role · runtime · signals · sources&lt;br&gt;SKILL.md + pyproject.toml (standalone package)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D14B4B;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="750" y="1366" width="700" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="sub_kernel" value="&lt;b&gt;kernel-agent/&lt;/b&gt; — &lt;b style=&quot;color:#B47A1A&quot;&gt;in-process tools library, NOT a subprocess&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;tools/kernel_optimization.py (107KB) · tracelens_analysis.py (98KB) ·&lt;br&gt;tracelens_skill_runner.py (55KB) · parallel_e2e_runner.py ·&lt;br&gt;apply_kernel_patch.py · geak_prompt_patcher.py ·&lt;br&gt;tools/backends/ (GEAK / OOB Ray-scheduled)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Caller:&lt;/b&gt; orchestrator/kernel_request_handlers.py imports directly" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E6;strokeColor=#B47A1A;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1460" y="1366" width="700" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="persist" value="&lt;b&gt;Persistence — $SESSION_DIR&lt;/b&gt; (default /workspace/hyperloom, flat layout; env: USER_DATA_PATH)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;state.json&lt;/b&gt; (atomic tmp+rename, Coordinator is the only writer) · &lt;b&gt;storage/coordinator.db&lt;/b&gt; (SQLite WAL · 4 tables: events / tasks / leases / cursors + schema_version)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;agents/{role}/{inbox,outbox}.jsonl&lt;/b&gt; · personas/ · checkpoints/ · &lt;b&gt;findings/&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;.json&lt;/b&gt; (RCA) · kb/ (Critic writes) · runs/&amp;lt;kind&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;task_id&amp;gt;/ · &lt;b&gt;critic-workdir/&amp;lt;turn&amp;gt;/&lt;/b&gt;{request, judge_bundle, review, emit}.json&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Auxiliary module outputs:&lt;/b&gt; baseline_comparison/ (InferenceX target_analyzer) · breakdown/ (collectors.py 110KB + reporters + SKILL.md) · roofline_integration.py (36KB · PMC roofline)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D6E9FF;strokeColor=#1F6AA8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1504" width="2120" height="108" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

